@page "/not-found"
@using DueMap.Web.Components.Shared
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

@*
    Target route for UseStatusCodePagesWithReExecute: any body-less 4xx from
    the pipeline (missing static file, API NotFound, etc.) re-executes here
    and renders the branded 404 while keeping the original status code.

    AllowAnonymous matters: the app has a global RequireAuthenticatedUser
    fallback policy, and this page must render for signed-out visitors too.
    (Signed-in users hitting unknown SPA paths are handled by the Router's
    <NotFound> fragment instead — see Routes.razor.)
*@

<NotFoundContent />
